Available Commands:
- Load Image: Click the "Load Image" button at the top of the screen and select an image to load. Must be JPG, JPEG, PNG, PPM, or BMP.
- Save Image: Click the "Save Image" button at the top of the screen and select the destination to save the image.
- Red-Component: Click the "Red Component" button at the right side of the screen.
- Green-Component: Click the "Green Component" button at the right side of the screen.
- Blue-Component: Click the "Blue Component" button at the right side of the screen.
- Value: Click the "Grayscale Using Value" button at the right side of the screen.
- Luma: Click the "Grayscale Using Luma" button at the right side of the screen.
- Intensity: Click the "Grayscale Using Intensity" button at the right side of the screen.
- Horizontal Flip: Click the "Flip Horizontally" button at the right side of the screen.
- Vertical Flip: Click the "Flip Vertically" button at the right side of the screen.
- Brighten: Click the "Brighten" button at the right side of the screen.
- Darken: Click the "Darken" button at the right side of the screen.
- Sharpen: Click the "Sharpen" button at the right side of the screen.
- Blur: Click the "Blur" button at the right side of the screen.
- Grayscale: Click the "Grayscale" button at the right side of the screen.
- Sepia: Click the "Sepia" button at the right side of the screen.
- To Quit: Click the "Exit" button at the top of the screen.
